"},"gapPct":-14.1,"verdict":"context","links":[{"label":"Korea.kr policy briefing, 2025 Population and Housing Census results (register-based), 28 Jul 2026","href":"https://www.korea.kr/briefing/policyBriefingView.do?newsId=156772432"}],"quotes":[{"text":"내국인은 4,971만 명으로 총 인구의 95.9%이며 전년대비 0.1%, 약 5만 명 감소했고, 외국인은 211만 명으로 전년대비 3.2%, 약 7만 명 증가했습니다.","href":"https://www.korea.kr/briefing/policyBriefingView.do?newsId=156772432"}],"accessed":"2026-10-29"},{"key":"births","kind":"researched","text":"South Korea registered 254,300 births in 2025, 6.7% more than in 2024 (Ministry of Data and Statistics, 2025 birth statistics). The UN expects 245,858 births in 2025, 3.3% fewer.","figure":{"value":254300,"what":"births, 2025 (final)","date":"2025"},"unFigure":{"value":245858,"what":"UN births, 2025","date":""},"gapPct":-3.3,"verdict":"un-lower","links":[{"label":"Ministry of Data and Statistics, 2025 Birth Statistics, 26 Aug 2026","href":"https://mods.go.kr/board.es?mid=a10301010000&bid=204&act=view&list_no=446625"}],"quotes":[{"text":"출생아 수는 25만 4천 3백 명으로 전년대비 1만 6천 명(6.7%) 증가","href":"https://mods.go.kr/board.es?mid=a10301010000&bid=204&act=view&list_no=446625"}],"accessed":"2026-10-29"}],"links":{"self":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/v1/countries/KOR.json","countries":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/v1/countries.json","risk":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/v1/risk.json","docs":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/api/","site":"https://fertility-tracker-live.vercel.app/country/KOR"}}
